{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっ！北野だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！59回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nシゲキさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっ！！！って気に入った♪\n普段から挨拶の前にやろうかな！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっ！北野です！みたいなかんじで！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャッチフレーズがほしい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/18/0743555/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海の音を探して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/18/0743555/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/18/0743555/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうはお昼前に1人で\n温泉に行きました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人でサウナにいて\nテレビのニュースを聞きながら\nいろんな人の世間話を聞きながら\nいろいろなことを思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家でダラダラするのが好きだけど\nこうやって外に出ていろんな知らない人と\n偶然居合わせた空間にいるだけで\nいろいろなことを思って考えられたので、\nやっぱり外に出ることも大切だな～と思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はまだ寒いからやっぱり外に出るには少し気がひけるけど、\n春になったらたくさん外に出て\n知らない道を歩いたり\n知らない空間にいってみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/18/0743555/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/18/0743555/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆若旦那さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは勉強は自分の部屋でやってたー！？それともリビングとかでやってたー！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎リビングの机でやってました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の部屋に机があったけど、\n重たい勉強道具をいっぱいリビングに持って行って満足してその2時間後とかにやり始めたりしてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆勇者きゃの丸さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁久しぶりにチップ見たいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いいよー！この間、お父さんとお母さんとカフェに行った時の！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/18/0743555/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/18/0743555/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あえて、よくわからないやつ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/18/0743555/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ゆうだーいさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんは誰にも共感してもらえない食べ物の組み合わせとかある？もしくは共感できない組み合わせとかある？\n俺の友達でご飯の上に焼きそば乗せて食べる人がいたから聞いてみた^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うーん。なんだろう。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっでも、どんな物を食べていても必ず飲み物は牛乳でその時は毎回お母さんに、\n「。。。。」っていう空気で見られてました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆四つ葉のしんのすけさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんが、メガ盛り食べてみたい食べ物はありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うな重と、カルボナーラ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆孫文さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今、体育でバスケをしています。レイアップシュートがうまくできません。コツなどあれば教えてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ゴールをしっかり見て、 しっかり地面を蹴ってシュートすれば大丈夫！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆マッキーノさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁スムージーのレシピを投稿\nしたいのですがどんな風に\n書いたら良いですか？\n例みたいなものがあると\n助かります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎小松菜  1/2束\nりんご  半分\n飲むヨーグルト   適量\nバナナ   1本\nハチミツ   適量"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな感じで書いてもらえたら分かりやすいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、何がどのくらい必要なのかわからなくて、でも何か組み合わせを思いついた！とかで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナ  りんご  みかん  小松菜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか、組み合わせの材料を書いてもらえるだけでも大丈夫です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あっちさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁46時間テレビって日奈子夜でれるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎高校を卒業しているので、深夜帯もでれますよー！がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆春のfree&easy高2さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんはソプラノとアルトどっちでしたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎アルトでした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆賢者の贈り物さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁20歳になるまでにやっておきたい事や克服したい事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"ty